    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious 3 bed 3 storey house\nRecently remediated for pyrite - new flooring thoughout the ground floor\n2 Dedicated Car Parking Spaces \nThis property has not been tested for pyrite / property built 20 years and has no signs.Main bedroom with built in wardrobes and ensuiteModern painted kitchen unitsPrivate rear courtyard with concrete shedGas central heating & double glazed windowClose to Castlemill S.C and the new link road to Naul RoadSpacious living room to rear with access to garden.\n\nNo. 55 Moylaragh Rise is an excellent 3 storey, 3-bedroomed mid terrace house with 2 dedicated car parking spaces to the front and private rear courtyard leading to an enclosed communal garden. The property comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. Moylaragh Rise is close to Castlemill Shopping centre and the new Castlemill link road to the Naul Road and M1 motorway. The accommodation briefly comprises hallway, kitchen diner to the front, sitting room to the rear with sliding door to the garden. Upstairs there are 3 double bedrooms and main bedroom ensuite and family bathroom. This property has not been tested for pyrite / property built 20 years and has no signs.\n\nLocated within walking distance of Balbriggan Town Centre and adjacent the new link road to Naul Rd. All local amenities including excellent shopping facilities, schools, and a good public transport infrastructure with Dublin Bus, Bus Eireann and Suburban Rail providing easy access to Dublin City Centre (c. 45 mins) are only minutes away. Also minutes' walk from the Castlemill shopping centre with a wide range of shops including Dunnes Stores."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.75m x 2.46m\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\nDining Room / Kitchen - 2.62m x 2.60m / 1.99m x 2.68m\nmodern shaker kitchen with built in oven, hob and extractor fan with wood flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 3.85m x 4.48m\nwith wood flooring, feature fireplace & backing with gas fire, TV point, sliding doors to rear.\n\nGuest WC - 0.78m x 1.81m\nwith wc, whb and laminate flooring.\n\nBedroom One - 3.85m x 3.23m\nwith laminate wood flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.84m x 1.52m\nwith wc, whb and pump shower.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.85m x 2.24m\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.84m x 2.44m\nwith laminate flooring with wc, whb and tiled around bath area.\n\nBedroom Three - 2.96m x 6.25m\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
